  "releaseNotes": "Version 2.25.0 - Code Fix Consolidation and Sample Verification\n\n            Refactoring:\n            - Consolidated AddPropertiesToTypeAsync into shared CodeFixSyntaxHelper (~130 lines removed)\n            - Added FindFuzzyMatches to FuzzyMatchHelper, used by AM004/AM006/AM011\n            - Removed delegating wrapper methods from AM011 code fix provider\n            - Fixed duplicate destPropertySymbol lookup in AM006 RegisterPerPropertyFixes\n\n            Fixes:\n            - Fixed AM006 not firing on samples (missing .editorconfig severity)\n            - Fixed CS8602 nullable warnings in AM004 CodeFixProvider\n            - Suppressed spurious AM041 diagnostics on correct example sections\n\n            Samples:\n            - Added AM006 correct fix examples (Ignore, MapFrom)\n            - Added UnmappedDestination category to sample runner\n            - Updated stale AM041 documentation in ConfigurationExamples.cs\n\n            Validation: 586 tests passing, 12 skipped, 0 warnings\n\n            Previous Release: v2.24.0 - Bug Fixes and Test Coverage",
